  66               /@66 -- LETS YOU RE-CONFIGURE EDU20C WITHOUT RE-LOADING THE
  67               /@67 -- ENTIRE PAPER TAPE FROM SCRATCH. THIS WAS USEFUL IN
  68               /@68 -- THE PUNCHED PAPER TAPE ERA, PARTICULARLY @ 110 BAUD.
  69               FOURTY=0        /@69 -- CREF SAYS FOURTY IS REFERENCED HERE
  70               /@70 -- ASSEMBLING WITH FOURTY <> 0 RELATES TO EDU 40. SEE
  71               /@71 -- CHAPTER 8 OF ABOVE EDUSYSTEM HANDBOOK FOR DETAIL.
